# Runtime/plugin locks include exact source bytes. Preserve the existing bytes
# on checkout; do not silently normalize newlines on different Windows settings.
* -text
# CRLF is deliberately retained above; treat its CR as a line ending, not a
# trailing-space error, while keeping ordinary whitespace checks enabled.
* whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol

*.mp4 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff2 binary
*.glb binary
